一、適用範圍 Scope
本條款適用於本儲存庫及其公開網站
(https://a7662888.github.io/ischemic-stroke-subtyping-zh-TW/) 中由作者創作之內容，
包括程式碼、分型決策實作、中英文介面與說明文字、說明書、教學案例、比較表格及視覺設計
（以下稱「本著作」）。
These terms cover the author's original work in this repository and its public website,
including source code, the classification-logic implementation, bilingual interface and
explanatory text, manual, teaching vignettes, comparison tables and visual design
("the Work").

二、允許之使用 Permitted use (no permission needed)
1. 於臨床照護、教學、學術研究等非營利目的，透過上述官方網址線上使用本工具。
   Using the tool at the official URL above for non-commercial clinical care, teaching
   and academic research.
2. 於論文、報告或簡報中引用本工具之分型結果，並依建議格式註明出處：
   Citing classification results produced by the tool in papers, reports or
   presentations, with attribution in the suggested form:
   Chen PH. Computerized Ischemic Stroke Etiologic Subtyping System
   (TOAST / MGH CCS / ASCOD), v<版本 version>. 2026.
   https://a7662888.github.io/ischemic-stroke-subtyping-zh-TW/
3. 分享上述官方網址連結。
   Sharing a link to the official URL.

