   (including separate deployments or offline bundles).
2. 改作、翻譯、衍生或將本著作嵌入其他軟體、醫院資訊系統、電子病歷或 AI 系統。
   Modifying, translating, creating derivative works, or embedding the Work in other
   software, hospital information systems, electronic medical records or AI systems.
3. 於出版品、教材或課程中重製本著作之文字、表格、圖像或截圖（單純引用結果除外）。
   Reproducing the Work's text, tables, figures or screenshots in publications,
   teaching materials or courses (beyond citing results).
4. 任何商業或營利用途，包括付費服務、產品、廣告或企業內部營運使用。
   Any commercial or for-profit use, including paid services, products, advertising or
   internal corporate operations.
